5,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Let's begin. Since we have no information, we should observe everyone's behavior and speech patterns.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It's a pleasure to be here with you all. Let's have a peaceful discussion, shall we?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. A logical approach is best. We should wait for the Seer to provide a lead.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A most sensible start. I shall enjoy observing how the truth unfolds among us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm so excited! I'll do my best to help the village find the werewolf!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, your energy is appreciated, but let's stay focused on the facts.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"He's just a spirited young man, Minako. It's quite refreshing.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, your kindness is noted, but we must remain vigilant.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. Vigilance is the only shield we have against deception.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,I am focused! I'm just really looking forward to this!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
