31,1,1,talk,Minako,,We are now in the first voting phase. Does anyone have information to share?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I'm afraid I don't. I'm just a simple villager hoping for the best.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It's early, but the Seer might have found something. Benjamin, you've been very quiet.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"My silence was merely contemplation. However, the time for contemplation has ended.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Did you find something, Benjamin? Tell us!","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minako,,"If Benjamin is the Seer, he should speak now to guide us.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, is someone about to be accused? I hope we don't make a mistake.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, if you have a result, please share it for the sake of the village.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Very well. I am the Seer, and my divination reveals that Shizue is the werewolf.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,What?! Shizue? But she's so nice! Are you sure?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minako,,"A direct claim on day one. Benjamin, this is a bold move, but it's efficient.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Oh my... Benjamin, why would you say such a thing? I would never hurt anyone.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, your gentle demeanor could be a mask. Benjamin's logic is usually sound.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I assure you, the result was unambiguous. The wolf hides behind a smile.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I can't believe it! Shizue is the werewolf? This is crazy!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minako,,The evidence provided by the Seer is our only lead. I'm inclined to trust him.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Please, everyone, think about this. I am just an old woman.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"In this game, age and kindness are not proofs of innocence. I vote for Shizue.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"The truth is often unpleasant, but it is necessary.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I don't want to, but if Benjamin is the Seer, we have to.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
